---
<footer class="w-full bg-surface-container-low mt-space-xl">
		<div
			class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin py-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter"
		>
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
					<img
						alt="PintoresPro Logo"
						class="h-7 w-auto object-contain"
						src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AEtjO1VRp_1XwtTM3wLwojUPDnRhzNqHOsGn89aZoPNH22Ouhz4R6hUDjUcSOffymUzlFFcSYu482cavVkuAXkOp3Esu1xjvl-ujECQ_CaIx7mIVtLcUjFCEVPq6-46m8xASXo0o6eVYsgwwjFOJS7U61nAKPEdIztVWAKZn0WbWJ1qEXzV8D0S1nis_0zol6WyTnV8xIv2HP2-1f5NEDcTfRBsodF-Og_7WyP5PNWrrWykBUt1bo8iEr5rchTs"
					/><span
						class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary"
						>PintoresPro</span>
				</div><p
					class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
				>
					Servicios profesionales de pintura interior y exterior
					para hogares y locales. Acabados arquitectónicos
					impecables, pulcritud absoluta y garantía de
					durabilidad.
				</p><div
					class="flex items-center gap-2 text-tertiary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm"
				>
					<span
						class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]"
						>verified</span
					><span class=""
						>Maestro Pintor Verificado • 15+ Años</span>
				</div>
			</div><div class="space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">
					Compromiso
				</h3><ul
					class="space-y-2 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
				>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
						<span
							class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px] mt-0.5"
							>shield_with_heart</span
						><span class=""
							>Garantía por escrito de 3 años en todos los
							trabajos.</span>
					</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2">
						<span
							class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px] mt-0.5"
							>cleaning_services</span
						><span class=""
							>Garantía de protección total y limpieza al
							finalizar cada jornada.</span>
					</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2">
						<span
							class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px] mt-0.5"
							>eco</span
						><span class=""
							>Pinturas ecológicas, lavables y con cero
							emisión de COV.</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div><div class="space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">
					Navegación
				</h3><nav
					class="flex flex-col space-y-2 font-body-sm text-body-sm"
				>
					<a
						class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors"
						data-path="inicio"
						href="#">Inicio</a
					><a
						class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors"
						data-path="galeria-de-trabajos"
						href="#">Galería de Trabajos</a
					><a
						class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors"
						data-path="sobre-mi"
						href="#">Sobre Mí</a
					><a
						class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors"
						data-path="cotizar-por-whatsapp"
						href="#">Cotizar por WhatsApp</a>
				</nav>
			</div><div class="space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">
					Contacto Rápido
				</h3><div
					class="space-y-2 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
				>
					<p class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<span
							class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]"
							>phone_in_talk</span
						><span class=""
							>Teléfono directo: +34 612 345 678</span>
					</p><p class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<span
							class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px]"
							>chat</span
						><span class=""
							>WhatsApp: Todos los días 08:00 - 21:00</span>
					</p><p class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<span
							class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]"
							>location_on</span
						><span class="">Atención en toda la comunidad</span>
					</p><div class="pt-2">
						<a
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest hover:bg-primary hover:text-on-primary text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors"
							href="https://wa.me/34612345678?text=Hola%2C%20quisiera%20pedir%20presupuesto%20para%20pintar%20mi%20vivienda"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							target="_blank"
							><span
								class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]"
								>send</span
							>Iniciar conversación inmediata</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div><div class="bg-surface-container py-4">
			<div
				class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2 text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm"
			>
				<span class=""
					>© 2025 PintoresPro. Todos los derechos reservados.</span
				><span class=""
					>Pintura Residencial y Decorativa Profesional</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</footer>